{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33759","headline":"正乐府十篇 颂夷臣 · 皮日休","name":"正乐府十篇 颂夷臣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夷师本学外，仍善唐文字。\n吾人本尚舍，何况夷臣事。\n所以不学者，反爲夷臣戏。\n所以尸禄人，反爲夷臣忌。\n吁嗟华风衰，何尝不由是。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}